Package: souk
Type: Package
Title: Trade, Groups and Institutions in a Simulated Village
Description: Simulates players who specialise, swap goods and invest their
    free time, and the groups they form to protect their trade. Rules for
    players, groups, markets and events are set separately in a modular way, and each day is
    a schedule of steps that can be replaced or extended.
